Factory Droid SDK for Haskell

This port is derived from the Factory Droid SDK public contracts and schemas.
The reference Python and TypeScript SDKs are distributed under Apache-2.0.

Upstream notice retained from the Python SDK:
Copyright 2025 The San Francisco AI Factory, Inc

The supplied JSON Schema documents are reproduced unchanged. Their provenance
and fingerprints are recorded in schema/manifest.json and docs/parity.md.

Hosted MCP transport contracts were also inspected in @modelcontextprotocol/sdk
1.29.0, distributed under the MIT license. No JavaScript runtime is required.

The jsonschema-0.3.0.1 package metadata and LICENSE declare MPL-2.0
(DPella AB). Inspected JSONSchema.Validation and JSONSchema.URIFragment
module headers instead declare LicenseRef-AllRightsReserved. This discrepancy
requires authoritative clarification before distribution sign-off; it is tracked
as hsdk-4po. The dependency is consumed separately, not vendored here.
Source: https://hackage.haskell.org/package/jsonschema-0.3.0.1.
